message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI Tools Pricing and Free Tier Limits (daily-verified open dataset)"
abstract: >-
  Daily-exported open dataset of AI tool pricing and free-tier limits, plus
  Taiwan credit cards, travel eSIM plans, VPN pricing, US stock brokers for
  Taiwan residents and crypto exchanges. Every row carries its official source
  URL and a last_verified date. Produced and maintained by an automated,
  self-checking AI workline.
